      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry that I just realized this, but the retry timeout logic needs to all move out of the TCPM and into the TCPC. I originally thought the TCPM could do it, but it isn\u0027t fast enough. See the last bits of b/150617035\n\nSorry Ed, that I didn\u0027t catch this on the first CL you submitted, and sorry I dropped the ball on that fix. The threads just kept pulling on that one. I need to get back to it soon.\n\nWhat do you want to do with this CL in light of this new information?",
